  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spot-check for Gender Equality 2022-2023 (WWF)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Stickprov och coaching f&#xF6;r j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet 2022-2023 (WWF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har genomf&#xF6;rt en upphandling via f&#xF6;rnyad konkurrensuts&#xE4;ttning av 4 st strategiska partnerorganisationer (SPO) och deras verksamhet g&#xE4;llande stickprovskontroll och coaching j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhetsintegrering och implementering av j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet i deras verksamhet.
Nu vill man g&#xF6;ra en liknande stickprovskontroll och coaching till en svensk strategisk partner organisation (V&#xE4;rldsnaturfonden, WWF). Uppdraget omfattar 152 timmar stickprov och h&#xF6;gst 48 timmar f&#xF6;r eventuell coaching och f&#xF6;r detta f&#xF6;resl&#xE5;s genomf&#xF6;ra ett avrop fr&#xE5;n rangordnat ramavtal f&#xF6;r det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has carried out a procurement via renewed competitive tendering of 4 strategic partner organizations (SPO) and their activities regarding spot check and coaching in gender mainstreaming and in implementation of gender equality in their activities.
Now they want to do a similar spot check and coaching to a Swedish strategic partner organization (World Wide Fund for Nature, WWF). The assignment comprises 152 hours of sampling and a maximum of 48 hours for coaching and for this it is proposed to implement a call-off from a ranked framework agreement for it.</narrative>
  </description>
